cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SynGenMol, please cite this software. A method paper is in preparation; this entry will be updated with its citation once it is published."
title: SynGenMol
abstract: >-
  A goal-directed framework for synthesizable molecular generation. SynGenMol
  assembles products from building blocks and reaction SMARTS templates, masks
  chemically incompatible choices during autoregressive decoding, and optimizes
  a compact policy with PPO against a task-specific molecular oracle.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/molecularinformatics/SynGenMol"
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: MIT
